<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken launches cash bid for Stadshypotek.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken launches cash bid for Stadshypotek.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Handelsbanken on Thursday launched a 23 billion crowns ($3.4 billion) cash bid for mortgage bank Stadshypotek which it said had been accepted by the Swedish state provided there were no better offers. ($ = 6.804 Swedish Crowns)</p>
</text>
